What this license covers

This license covers the new program code, tests and documents written for
this clone (the "My Brain by Josh Kennedy, inspired by Jim Kitchen" project).
That code was written from a description of how Jim Kitchen's original
program behaves and contains none of his program code.

It does not cover the 42 sound files in assets\sounds. Those are Jim Kitchen's
original wav files. He was blind from birth, made his games free for the blind
community, and died in 2015. His permission to use the wav files was given to
Josh Kennedy; the original email is lost. They are included on the maintainer's
own responsibility. If a rights holder asks for them to be removed, they will
be removed.

Third-party parts keep their own licenses: see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.
